compile:
warning: $REPO/examples/tests/agent.yaml:14:27: deny_read $REPO/examples/tests/out/keys lies inside write entry $REPO/examples/tests/out: at tier landlock the run's reads are held (fs.reads: auto), so the open deputy completes every read open, each read open about 0.1 ms more, and this target is refused; a copy of it the agent moves or hard-links to another name is not (capability fs.deny_read.moved) [held-reads]
  fix: move the secret outside the write entry to read directly, or pin a root tier
